# NetRescue — Website Design Document (v2, with Features Pages)

**Product Reference:** NetRescue PRD v5.0
**Stack:** React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion + React Router
**Deliverable:** Landing page **+ standalone Features index page + individual Feature detail pages**

> **What's new in v2:** The three feature cards on the landing page now **navigate to real routes** (`/features` and `/features/:id`) instead of opening a modal overlay. The overlay is demoted to an optional quick-preview. Everything else (design system, motion tokens, typography, video behavior) is unchanged.

