### 1.5 Reusable Primitives

1. **`ScrambleIn`** — entrance text reveal (interval 25ms, 0.5 chars/frame, random chars up to 3 ahead of cursor, spaces preserved, pre-trigger renders `&nbsp;`).
2. **`ScrambleText`** — hover-driven scramble (4 frames/char on hover, instant reset on unhover).
3. **`SquashHamburger`** — 3-bar animated hamburger (desktop 18×12px, mobile 15×10px; top/bottom rotate ±45°, middle fades).
4. **`NetRescueLogo`** — 4-fold symmetric node-link SVG (see §2).
5. **`VideoBackground`** — wrapper for autoplay/loop or scrubbed video with overlay gradients.
6. **`PageShell`** — layout wrapper for the Features index and detail pages (sticky header, scroll container, footer).
7. **`FeatureOverlay`** *(optional)* — quick-preview modal retained for the landing page only.

