## 11. Acceptance Checklist (Design)

**Landing:**
- [ ] Hero video scrubs on horizontal mouse movement (delta-based, seeked-chained, sensitivity 0.8); no autoplay on hero.
- [ ] Sections 2–4 and Footer autoplay muted loop their videos.
- [ ] Space Mono applied globally; Anton SC only for watermarks.
- [ ] Logo renders as 4-fold symmetric SVG at 18×18 (pills) and 24×24 (headers).
- [ ] Clicking any feature card on the landing **navigates to `/features/:id`** (URL changes, no overlay).

**Features index:**
- [ ] `/features` renders hero band + three feature rows.
- [ ] Each row is a full `<Link>` to the corresponding detail page.
- [ ] Breadcrumb shows `Home / Features`.

**Feature detail:**
- [ ] `/features/feature-a`, `/features/feature-c`, `/features/feature-d` render without error.
- [ ] Each page shows hero band, sidebar nav, four content sections (Purpose, Specification, Acceptance, Research), and prev/next footer.
- [ ] Sidebar tracks active section via `IntersectionObserver`.
- [ ] Deep links work: `/features/feature-a#specification` scrolls to that section.
- [ ] Prev/next links navigate within `features.ts` order; disabled at ends.
- [ ] `document.title` updates to the feature title.

**General:**
- [ ] Same Navbar and Footer on every route.
- [ ] Page transitions: fade + y-slide (spring `{260, 26}`), `AnimatePresence mode="wait"`.
- [ ] Scroll position resets to top of new route's container on navigation.
- [ ] All motion honors `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- [ ] No external APIs, no telemetry, no analytics scripts.
- [ ] Card grid, index rows, detail pages, prev/next, and breadcrumbs driven by a single `features.ts`.

